<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  ---			   C/S =  3.82%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  ---			   O/N =  ----</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.27%			 T/N =  -----</p>
<p>		   Jan  20, 1997			Jan 17, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  4.62%	1 month forward =  5.09%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.04%	2 month forward =  6.11%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.83%	3 month forward =  6.90%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.99%	4 month forward =  7.13%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.17%	5 month forward =  7.26%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.23%	6 month forward =  7.31%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
